sequenceDiagram
    participant Cam as Camera
    participant Core as Monitor Core
    participant Aud as Audio Module
    participant FB as Firebase
    participant UI as Stream Client

    loop Real-time loop
        Cam->>Core: frame
        Core->>FB: get control/status
        alt status = on
            Core->>Core: detect person and check zone
            alt outside zone
                Core->>FB: push baby_moved
            end
            Core->>Aud: trigger audio window
            Aud->>Aud: record, extract MFCC, classify
            alt cry or uncertain
                Aud->>Core: callback(true)
                Core->>FB: push cry_detected
            end
        else status = off
            Core->>Core: skip monitoring logic
        end
        Core->>UI: MJPEG frame
    end
